{"full":"hf:VAST-AI/AniGen","spaceId":"VAST-AI/AniGen","name":"AniGen","source":"huggingface","description":"Generate animatable and articulated 3D assets from images","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":78,"created":"2026-03-04T09:47:23.000Z","updated":"2026-06-12T00:42:25.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://vast-ai-anigen.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VAST-AI/AniGen","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:30.886Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:30.886Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:30.886Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✦","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AniGen is a unified framework that directly generates animate-ready 3D assets conditioned on a single image. Our key insight is to represent shape, skeleton, and skinning as mutually consistent $S^3$ Fields (Shape, Skeleton, Skin) defined over a shared spatial domain. To enable the robust learning of these fields, we introduce two technical innovations: (i) a confidence-decaying skeleton field that explicitly handles the geometric ambiguity of bone prediction at Voronoi boundaries, and (ii) a dual skin feature field that decouples skinning weights from specific joint counts, allowing a…","AniGen takes a single image as input and automatically produces a fully rigged, animate-ready 3D asset, complete with a coherent mesh, an articulated skeleton, and smooth skinning weights. The generated assets can be directly imported into standard 3D pipelines and driven by off-the-shelf motion data, enabling immediate deployment across a wide spectrum of downstream applications, including embodied AI agent construction, physics-based simulation, character animation, dynamic scene creation, and articulated object manipulation.","Machine Arm Machine Dog Money Tree Iron Boy Mairo Evo Horse Eagle"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggin